# Mirrors must stay byte-identical to upstream: any checkout-time line-ending
# conversion changes data/*.csv bytes and therefore the sha256 snapshots recorded
# in data/catalog-summary.json (checked by skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/validate_data.py).
* -text

*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
